{"schema_version":"1.0","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-ue1/","title":"주첨 EX-UE1","language":"ko-KR","description":"경외기혈 주첨의 위치·취혈·자침 정보를 정리합니다.","text":"주첨 EX-UE1\n분류\n경외기혈 · 코드 EX-UE1\n위치\n위팔의 뒷면(post. part of arm), 자뼈팔꿈치머리에서 뾰족하게 튀어나온 곳.\n취혈\n팔을 굽혔을 때, 팔꿈치 끝에서 뾰족하게 튀어나온 지점을 취혈한다.\n자침·주의\n艾炷灸 3～7壯\n임상 연결\n경외기혈은 관련 부위·증상과 14경맥의 경혈을 함께 보고 배혈합니다.\n→ 경외기혈 통합 목록","sections":[{"title":"분류","level":2,"url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-ue1/#_1","text":"경외기혈 · 코드 EX-UE1","links":[]},{"title":"위치","level":2,"url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-ue1/#_2","text":"위팔의 뒷면(post. part of arm), 자뼈팔꿈치머리에서 뾰족하게 튀어나온 곳.","links":[]},{"title":"취혈","level":2,"url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-ue1/#_3","text":"팔을 굽혔을 때, 팔꿈치 끝에서 뾰족하게 튀어나온 지점을 취혈한다.","links":[]},{"title":"자침·주의","level":2,"url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-ue1/#_4","text":"艾炷灸 3～7壯","links":[]},{"title":"임상 연결","level":2,"url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-ue1/#_5","text":"경외기혈은 관련 부위·증상과 14경맥의 경혈을 함께 보고 배혈합니다.\n→ 경외기혈 통합 목록","links":["https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupoint-network/extra-points/"]}],"headings":[{"level":2,"title":"분류","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-ue1/#_1"},{"level":2,"title":"위치","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-ue1/#_2"},{"level":2,"title":"취혈","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-ue1/#_3"},{"level":2,"title":"자침·주의","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-ue1/#_4"},{"level":2,"title":"임상 연결","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-ue1/#_5"}],"links":["https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupoint-network/extra-points/"],"related_reading":[],"interpretation":"Public article text and navigation only; links do not establish clinical equivalence or treatment recommendations.","provenance":{"document_id":"MSA-B1B6513E3B47672A","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-ue1/","text_sha256":"6a299af808ca52f3fd0f561a336c0edc81947830bebc021163a3eeda5e92b643","source_sha256":"4f25806910d0a926bc4fbba8e026d8eb5eda33fc5a05c5a7bc338b38242f003c","commit":"829c286ab0c3a2408fa5d8a5f0c8349a3a31ca7c"}}
